  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a large frying pan, heat the butter and a drizzle of olive oil over a high heat. Cook ginger paste, cauliflower rice, 1/2 the garlic and 1/2 the vegetable stock powder, stirring, until tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Season with salt and pepper. Transfer to a large bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a74044de641e215142c64d/step-6d79affe.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium heat.\n• Cook lentils and Sri Lankan spice blend, stirring, until fragrant,1-2 minutes.\n• Add coconut milk and remaining vegetable stock powder. Cook, stirring occasionally, until slightly thickened, 3-4 minutes. Season to taste. TIP: Add a splash of water if the sauce looks too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a74044de641e215142c64d/step-8da1050f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While lentils are cooking, return frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add spinach and remaining garlic and cook until just wilted and fragrant,1 minute.\n• Transfer veggies to bowl with cauliflower rice. Gently toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a74044de641e215142c64d/step-097641da.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice long red chilli (if using).\n• Divide Sri Lankan-spiced coconut lentils and cauliflower-veggie rice between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with chilli and torn mint leaves to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61a74044de641e215142c64d/step-55a8b904.jpg"
    }
  ]
